<body>
    <h1>UX Interview Stage3 &amp; Stage5 Dashboard Design</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <h2 local-id=3D"2ba1766d94ed" id=3D"UXInterviewStage3&amp;Stage5Das=
hboardDesign-1.Overview"><strong>1. Overview</strong></h2>
<p local-id=3D"64213f53a910">This document outlines the UX interview framew=
ork and discussion approach for designing the <strong>Agent Performance &am=
p; Case Review Dashboard (Stage 3 &amp; Stage 5)</strong>.</p>
<p local-id=3D"890cd458fbf7">The dashboard aims to help stakeholders:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"e00810f5-8d52-4573-b902-b64b81dc3dbd">
<li local-id=3D"d6736cc9-2748-4c3e-bb69-e5ac865952af">
<p local-id=3D"eef0129c432d">Monitor agent performance</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f63aca64-db06-49de-b52c-b8bf3de806e6">
<p local-id=3D"3c96de1beb07">Track case outcomes and mitigation coverage</p=
></li>
<li local-id=3D"1afefc8c-15c1-475a-8799-0852bf0fdb7b">
<p local-id=3D"f7b6288141a4">Analyse bot decisions (Green, Amber, Red)</p><=
/li>
<li local-id=3D"dd75835e-1b2b-4559-91a3-8ce044d20571">
<p local-id=3D"45be6a9bf838">Improve templates, governance, and QA processe=
s</p></li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"fddb3070-a75e-45ba-b768-b835e9b0e7fd">
<h2 local-id=3D"30cc176ec08d" id=3D"UXInterviewStage3&amp;Stage5DashboardDe=
sign-2.ObjectivesoftheDashboard"><strong>2. Objectives of the Dashboard</st=
rong></h2>
<p local-id=3D"5184e9511d54">The primary goals of this dashboard are:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"2be66079-fd46-4578-a866-901f4ebc437f">
<li local-id=3D"ba11a659-59d6-454f-9799-9e2b98e45a82">
<p local-id=3D"d9802c6fdeb3"><strong>Performance Monitoring</strong>: Track=
 agent-level productivity and outcomes</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"427f5418-3556-4e90-b885-e8d9393b10f8">
<p local-id=3D"20d511a64578"><strong>Decision Visibility</strong>: Understa=
nd bot decision classifications (Green, Amber, Red)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ba0e87c7-281a-4af9-958d-e653d7c65c95">
<p local-id=3D"92a6fd7a6512"><strong>Mitigation Tracking</strong>: Identify=
 gaps in mitigation handling</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"dcb5c77f-1443-4bd5-9eb7-3223c8f4c032">
<p local-id=3D"3d261e5da604"><strong>Quality Improvement</strong>: Analyse =
amendments (minor/major) and missed mitigations</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"52274bd4-6d29-4f62-88eb-cb075484e2bf">
<p local-id=3D"63e6fbf719d8"><strong>Operational Insights</strong>: Enable =
quick identification of issues and root causes</p></li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"f750173c-3357-4bd7-a568-5bae4c2a877d">
<h2 local-id=3D"8f13b6d45ccd" id=3D"UXInterviewStage3&amp;Stage5DashboardDe=
sign-3.KeyFeatures(BasedonRequirements)"><strong>3. Key Features (Based on =
Requirements)</strong></h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"5c19cd05587d" id=3D"UXInterviewStage3&amp;Stage5DashboardDe=
sign-3.1TableView"><strong>3.1 Table View</strong></h3>
<p local-id=3D"2bed9dc74e79">Displays:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"d18e18e6-ce5e-49bd-aeea-3cc843247be6">
<li local-id=3D"979986fb-331a-4cc1-b2e5-925fdb5c0145">
<p local-id=3D"76e1fe594642">Agent Name</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"0605cecb-5190-4451-ba65-b958833bca0f">
<p local-id=3D"545f71a344ee">PCN Number</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a7eebb36-4430-40bf-9b64-99dc3d87f8b6">
<p local-id=3D"d67a7bd8c557">Number of Cases Reviewed</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"8315f626-c756-4726-8973-9ca6f27d70a2">
<p local-id=3D"1e5fb14bd076">Contravention Codes</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"525bd801-8c8a-4147-a8d3-7d47d8dc9816">
<p local-id=3D"6c15dccfd383">Mitigation Status</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"6955332c3b53" id=3D"UXInterviewStage3&amp;Stage5DashboardDe=
sign-3.2Widgets(5Total)"><strong>3.2 Widgets (5 Total)</strong></h3>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"3dcd0000-d879-459c-b2ed-fd797402fb32">
<li local-id=3D"9449bf79-906b-4999-9d02-9c96597d500a">
<p local-id=3D"8f6221b54ff1"><strong>Green Cases (Positive outcomes)</stron=
g></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"dd23ca15-a3b5-4e26-9125-94d54d1d39ec">
<p local-id=3D"ace740342764"><strong>Amber Cases (Partial / Needs attention=
)</strong></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a0e2264c-2829-4326-8b38-1c80b7200f7f">
<p local-id=3D"b359c12bbbb3"><strong>Red Cases (Failures / Issues)</strong>=
</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"0843c465-046c-4ee2-99fe-6890a2eeb515">
<p local-id=3D"b4da6a56a738"><strong>Agent Amendments</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"15379cbf-eb92-43cd-a191-8b408b25c276">
<li local-id=3D"40794bd3-f767-4498-8c48-e0f0bee5430f">
<p local-id=3D"49e38e7cdaf6">Minor / Major changes made per letter</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"2bd4aec9-deb6-4bf7-a612-b2eb0a30a77c">
<p local-id=3D"7ea27e1162f8"><strong>No Amendment Cases</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"0ecab9d6-ba97-4470-8415-c45ac47f1bcb">
<li local-id=3D"c0fa4b40-ea61-4166-a34a-02655c5088c9">
<p local-id=3D"5ddf65fd5c37">Letters sent directly without changes</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ol>
<hr local-id=3D"d638f8d6-24d9-4516-9870-47840d22d547">
<h2 local-id=3D"dcf5641f95c0" id=3D"UXInterviewStage3&amp;Stage5DashboardDe=
sign-4.UXResearchGoals"><strong>4. UX Research Goals</strong></h2>
<p local-id=3D"e623ca5d5582">The interview aims to:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"8a694aee-bd2b-4706-8d26-00307935d72f">
<li local-id=3D"b33b3176-a157-4d05-b73b-9a54348eb87b">
<p local-id=3D"8665bb56cadb">Validate how users interpret and use metrics</=
p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5c6b713a-284c-457d-a838-9da7fa2b44b8">
<p local-id=3D"f9144c195df4">Identify gaps in current workflows</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d7e2dc4d-85aa-4a52-b148-cf1e445f73e9">
<p local-id=3D"ff1439ede025">Define drill-down and filtering needs</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"c1e2536b-c089-4a9c-93f6-cee93f031812">
<p local-id=3D"4b16b72b630d">Clarify decision-making requirements</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9ca8444b-95a4-4b17-8890-9129286be488">
<p local-id=3D"52d4c231e0ad">Improve dashboard usability and hierarchy</p><=
/li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"ca7ec2f7-c440-45c8-a0a2-4969fad89e8b">
<h2 local-id=3D"ce30a60ada01" id=3D"UXInterviewStage3&amp;Stage5DashboardDe=
sign-5.InterviewQuestions&amp;Intent"><strong>5. Interview Questions &amp; =
Intent</strong></h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"ff60e96421c1" id=3D"UXInterviewStage3&amp;Stage5DashboardDe=
sign-5.1Decision-MakingContext"><strong>5.1 Decision-Making Context</strong=
></h3>
<p local-id=3D"5ad0137fcf1a"><strong>Question:</strong><br>
What are the key decisions you expect to make using this dashboard on a dai=
ly or weekly basis?</p>
<p local-id=3D"bb8c7120ba55"><strong>Purpose:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"19e6cdeb-b2db-4b26-b79e-7f76c0697abd">
<li local-id=3D"dc13e572-cf44-42df-b4db-1461c0c6cdcb">
<p local-id=3D"9d8ddaac3a00">Understand user goals</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"8fe66952-85b9-42bc-ba31-4eefc5407244">
<p local-id=3D"37ba7af9294d">Identify critical actions (monitoring, escalat=
ion, QA checks)</p></li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"0c56d8d0-e76a-4b35-8857-75b6ae353f14">
<h3 local-id=3D"5b15c9798685" id=3D"UXInterviewStage3&amp;Stage5DashboardDe=
sign-5.2CurrentChallenges"><strong>5.2 Current Challenges</strong></h3>
<p local-id=3D"46b9ad47cb4e"><strong>Question:</strong><br>
What challenges do you usually face in tracking case outcomes, mitigation c=
overage, or bot decisions?</p>
<p local-id=3D"1eddd1088961"><strong>Purpose:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"a8cdef45-09a7-437d-8dd6-273beaa0a835">
<li local-id=3D"132dc420-c1c6-4fce-ac7b-9254ccc2ef11">
<p local-id=3D"152afb8adda5">Identify pain points such as:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"e2af4718-b7aa-4bf8-96ec-d3043be01abc">
<li local-id=3D"02298f74-c879-4708-857f-e050a6bec410">
<p local-id=3D"c725f7ff52d4">Lack of visibility</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d4a41610-c6b4-4a4e-b706-aadf7651cf4c">
<p local-id=3D"8177b9318ebb">Difficulty tracing decisions</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5302ccf2-3253-4f0d-a59e-c5f93f2a02a3">
<p local-id=3D"95cc093ccef9">Data fragmentation</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"7c7ece10-ff13-4d14-a755-dcd5a1b498f0">
<h3 local-id=3D"264c328a8e04" id=3D"UXInterviewStage3&amp;Stage5DashboardDe=
sign-5.3CriticalMetrics"><strong>5.3 Critical Metrics</strong></h3>
<p local-id=3D"7d75cebedb9c"><strong>Question:</strong><br>
Which metrics are most critical for you (e.g., mitigation missing, Amber re=
asons, Red cases, amendments), and why?</p>
<p local-id=3D"d4e2e049b95f"><strong>Purpose:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"d7ece5f9-ffa4-4485-a24c-98bae9979e6c">
<li local-id=3D"9dd61d86-53cd-472b-8522-0fbdaf8531b3">
<p local-id=3D"35225e08cf9b">Prioritize widgets and KPIs</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"94556f37-8f66-4017-a5c3-f4c9b22107fe">
<p local-id=3D"b35a2c54a548">Decide visual hierarchy</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a3b8f271-9992-4d7e-91c5-988a7e2e5d58">
<p local-id=3D"405f9b921528">Avoid overloading dashboard</p></li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"906463cc-44c5-4bbd-855a-3676ea8e81ab">
<h3 local-id=3D"3a7c73e09e0c" id=3D"UXInterviewStage3&amp;Stage5DashboardDe=
sign-5.4DecisionInterpretation"><strong>5.4 Decision Interpretation</strong=
></h3>
<p local-id=3D"c6d6be7fd7c7"><strong>Question:</strong><br>
How do you want to interpret Green, Amber, and Red decisions, and what addi=
tional context would help you analyse them?</p>
<p local-id=3D"983eb8d0cb6a"><strong>Purpose:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"9e17c98d-2d57-44c9-83ca-230e72375de4">
<li local-id=3D"5ad065db-8518-4ba4-8fad-072fc91270dc">
<p local-id=3D"f9ecd259d37d">Align meaning of decision categories</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d6647bac-81c0-4a9b-9087-7a7c714eb17f">
<p local-id=3D"20ffaba1d62e">Identify need for supporting context such as:<=
/p>
<ul local-id=3D"1f691a2d-2094-4bb0-a2e3-c95269b12ce0">
<li local-id=3D"029368bf-a798-49b7-9901-c26d8b89e691">
<p local-id=3D"9f1d476c63d3">Reasons for Amber/Red</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"768ea56e-7fb6-4076-841e-b1907bd68d16">
<p local-id=3D"5f36ae76b7c7">Agent actions</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"57184503-f5e4-446b-bbed-3fac4d31d67c">
<p local-id=3D"5603b2560b47">Case details</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"54362b28-451e-4b5c-80da-2b848908423c">
<h3 local-id=3D"24d748eea9a2" id=3D"UXInterviewStage3&amp;Stage5DashboardDe=
sign-5.5Drill-DownExpectations"><strong>5.5 Drill-Down Expectations</strong=
></h3>
<p local-id=3D"a424a1afc345"><strong>Question:</strong><br>
When you see a summary metric (e.g., high Amber count), what level of detai=
l do you need to investigate further?</p>
<p local-id=3D"b958ff249026"><strong>Purpose:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"467f59b0-c6d9-4d44-88ac-e3aa96242fbd">
<li local-id=3D"fdec1860-4fef-4614-a4bd-6a8c83751e73">
<p local-id=3D"5635f32559db">Define drill-down layers:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"87352236-0b70-4057-8425-d8675d04a924">
<li local-id=3D"29c17970-531b-4cb6-ba1a-7cf7670211ea">
<p local-id=3D"b318b6ea5ca0">Widget =E2=86=92 Table =E2=86=92 Case details<=
/p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"db650b63-f596-4919-9163-dc539afb2e0e">
<p local-id=3D"261ca4045751">Understand depth of analysis required</p></li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"2706a67b-36c6-45b7-98bb-b8a726de044c">
<h3 local-id=3D"2fe5a5bb545e" id=3D"UXInterviewStage3&amp;Stage5DashboardDe=
sign-5.6Filtering&amp;Segmentation"><strong>5.6 Filtering &amp; Segmentatio=
n</strong></h3>
<p local-id=3D"5dba75f47eb8"><strong>Question:</strong><br>
What filters or segmentation (e.g., agent, stage, PCN, contravention code) =
do you use most often?</p>
<p local-id=3D"6400149ffaf2"><strong>Purpose:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"2cc2809e-3ffc-4646-8762-6a8103b5a834">
<li local-id=3D"7ad396b5-3a95-49d9-aaa4-8462882fc955">
<p local-id=3D"30364d7e3b74">Design filtering system</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"22cb6a19-5d40-4717-a8b5-9e5acdf242ae">
<p local-id=3D"f505303d6077">Support quick slicing of data</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"3030a021-626f-4bdb-88f7-2a7c05eae554">
<p local-id=3D"e120d67c978f">Enable targeted insights</p></li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"44efb745-2e7e-483e-9612-ac287adcfe98">
<h3 local-id=3D"cbac354e0b8c" id=3D"UXInterviewStage3&amp;Stage5DashboardDe=
sign-5.7InsightUtilisation"><strong>5.7 Insight Utilisation</strong></h3>
<p local-id=3D"fc4733131981"><strong>Question:</strong><br>
How would you use insights from missing mitigations or custom inputs to imp=
rove templates or policies?</p>
<p local-id=3D"eba40daaed43"><strong>Purpose:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"5b5c7b9a-433d-4aeb-b9a9-af68ae7ee81c">
<li local-id=3D"c9c31639-d8e5-4194-bec3-cd627ed7adc5">
<p local-id=3D"8c89fa2428c8">Connect dashboard insights to action</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1da766a3-66b9-4d0e-874e-0a16dddecd8b">
<p local-id=3D"ab941bf8c828">Support:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"0af60827-a161-4558-b033-d0a6cd8e1c8f">
