<h1 local-id=3D"649943987027" id=3D"UXInterviewStage3&amp;Stage5DashboardDe=
sign-UXInterview&amp;DiscussionDocument">UX Interview &amp; Discussion Docu=
ment</h1>
<p local-id=3D"18c74070cac0"><strong>Project:</strong> Agent Mitigation &am=
p; Case Review Dashboard<br><strong>Prepared by:</strong> UX Team<br><stron=
g>Context:</strong> Stage 3 &amp; 5 Dashboard Requirements (5 widgets + det=
ailed table)<br><br><strong>Initial Questions</strong><br>
 1. What are the key decisions you expect to make using this dashboard on a=
 daily or weekly basis?<br>
(Aligns with the objective of monitoring performance, coverage, and decisio=
ns)</p>
<ol start=3D"2" local-id=3D"443a1c4af8c4">
<li local-id=3D"85da49193ea7">
<p local-id=3D"35ff1af21d79">What challenges do you usually face in trackin=
g case outcomes, mitigation coverage, or bot decisions?<br>
(Helps identify gaps the dashboard aims to solve=E2=80=94visibility, tracea=
bility, etc.)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e13d3cb31f08">
<p local-id=3D"338510d53828">Which metrics are most critical for you (e.g.,=
 mitigation missing, Amber reasons, Red cases, amendments), and why?<br>
(Relates to widgets and reporting priorities)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"2ab1fb4e79ff">
<p local-id=3D"aa0c882ddb6b">How do you want to interpret Green, Amber, and=
 Red decisions, and what additional context would help you analyse them?<br=
>
(Tied to bot decision tracking and improvement needs)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f023076f3583">
<p local-id=3D"a10f763d73a2">When you see a summary metric (e.g., high Ambe=
r count), what level of detail do you need to investigate the issue further=
?<br>
(Linked to table view and drill-down requirements)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"bbb3b44e0aca">
<p local-id=3D"a89f649d2cdd">What filters or segmentation (e.g., agent, sta=
ge, PCN, contravention code) do you use most often to analyse data?<br>
(Directly aligned to dashboard filter requirements)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"c68734c4efc7">
<p local-id=3D"79a2d8b9f33b">How would you use insights from missing mitiga=
tions or custom inputs to improve templates or policies?<br>
(Supports template governance use case)</p></li>
</ol>
<hr local-id=3D"a13c4ea8-fc82-4e97-999e-b3697fdfc5fd">
<h2 local-id=3D"0f6e2f8c6106" id=3D"UXInterviewStage3&amp;Stage5DashboardDe=
