<p local-id=3D"34e5801b9539">Monitor <strong>agent performance</strong></p>=
</li>
<li local-id=3D"13507832-73a3-49aa-b875-50f81d7eee0a">
<p local-id=3D"a27d88d21ec1">Track <strong>case outcomes (Green / Amber / R=
ed)</strong></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a5550128-1260-4ef2-96ca-e460e6a1e44a">
<p local-id=3D"362fc8319a0e">Identify <strong>missing mitigations and decis=
ion gaps</strong></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"095e919f-5cb7-4c1b-bb55-073bbd1a4b7f">
<p local-id=3D"a66f15fb6cad">Improve <strong>bot accuracy, templates, and p=
olicies</strong></p></li>
