<h3 local-id=3D"79e11d9c7c72" id=3D"UXInterviewStage3&amp;Stage5DashboardDe=
sign-=E2=9D=93Q2:Challengesintrackingoutcomes&amp;mitigations?">=E2=9D=93 Q=
2: Challenges in tracking outcomes &amp; mitigations?</h3>
<p local-id=3D"f44137235f48"><strong>User Insights:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"3b6e9f9e-98cc-497e-8aac-d1d443ae61ed">
<li local-id=3D"801d1fd3-9533-4c63-a098-3d0c8b89e2be">
<p local-id=3D"7beb623df9ce">Lack of <strong>visibility on missing mitigati=
on</strong></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"2114a6e3-1c13-4e24-a947-5b42983a1b62">
<p local-id=3D"f92bb653df07">Hard to track <strong>why Amber/Red occurred</=
strong></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f9085995-ab46-4fe1-b610-8b46ce6d27ee">
<p local-id=3D"ade67d8801a8">Poor <strong>traceability across agents and ca=
ses</strong></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"aadb1cf4-95bb-4b7f-91f7-99eb3e9762c5">
<p local-id=3D"e11799e2aab5">Difficulty linking <strong>decisions to root c=
auses</strong></p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"469680c33206">=E2=9C=85 <strong>UX Implications</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"39517334-192b-4f29-8493-7f210b1caf2d">
<li local-id=3D"0d0cd6ae-2789-449d-adef-d8b69b1abac8">
<p local-id=3D"ffd5d52334da">Need for <strong>clear categorisation + contex=
